# AI Platform Runtime (DO NOT COMMIT)
.ai-platform/
*.active-port.json
active-provider.json

# Cross-harness session snapshot (personal/ephemeral, may include conversation
# content - DO NOT COMMIT). RESUME_NOTE.md is static guidance and stays tracked.
# Matched with ** since the hook that writes this snapshots relative to whatever
# directory was current when it fired, not always the repo root (e.g. a stray
# copy showed up under memory-service/.ai-context/ mid-session).
**/.ai-context/SESSION_STATE.md
**/.ai-context/.SESSION_STATE.md.tmp

# Logs
logs/
*.jsonl
*.log

